A [[Gender|female]] [[Twi'lek]] worked as a '''server''' in [[Garsa Fwip's Sanctuary]], a [[cantina]] in [[Mos Espa]] owned by [[Garsa Fwip]]. When [[Daimyo]] [[Boba Fett]] and his [[assassin]] [[Fennec Shand]] visited the establishment, the server and her [[Unidentified Twi'lek male server|partner]] greeted them and took their [[helmet]]s for cleaning. Once they were returned, Fett and Shand found that the crime lord's helmet had been filled with [[Galactic Credit Standard|credits]]. She was present at the Sanctuary when the [[Hutt]] [[twin]]s arrived in [[Mos Espa]] and later witnessed the [[gladiator]] [[Krrsantan]] assault a group of [[Trandoshan]] [[gambler]]s. She was [[Death|killed]] within Garsa's Sanctuary when the [[Pyke Syndicate]] rigged a [[camtono]] to [[Destruction of Garsa Fwip's Sanctuary|explode]] within the establishment.

==Biography==
[[File:Twilek_Servers_Greet_Fett_Shand.png|thumb|left|300px|The server and her colleague greeted the leaders of the new criminal empire.]]
In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date" /> a [[Gender|female]]<ref name="Audio Description" /> [[Twi'lek]] server worked at [[Garsa Fwip's Sanctuary]]<ref name="Stranger in a Strange Land" /> on the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]]<ref name="Tatooine DB">{{Databank|tatooine|Tatooine}}</ref> under her Twi'lek boss, Madam [[Garsa Fwip]]. When the [[crime lord]] [[Boba Fett]] and his partner, [[Master Assassin]] [[Fennec Shand]], visited the [[cantina]], the Twi'lek server and a [[Unidentified Twi'lek male server|male colleague]] welcomed the pair and offered to clean their [[helmet]]s. While Shand initially refused, Fett accepted the offer and requested Shand's cleaned as well. The female took Fett's helmet while her male colleague took Shand's. When the crime lord and Fwip neared the end of their conversation, Fwip clapped to signal both servers to return with the helmets. After Fwip thanked Fett for his visit and departed, the female returned Fett's helmet to him and the male returned Shand's. As the servers left, Shand took notice that Fett's helmet had [[Galactic Credit Standard|credits]] inside.<ref name="Stranger in a Strange Land" />

When Fett and Shand returned to the Sanctuary with two [[Gamorrean]] guards on the advice of [[Mayor of Mos Espa|Mayor]] [[Mok Shaiz]], the server whispered to Fwip to note their arrival.<ref name="The Tribes of Tatooine">{{BOBF|Chapter 2: The Tribes of Tatooine}}</ref> Some time later, she greeted a group of [[gambling]] [[Trandoshan]]s at the Sanctuary moments before [[Krrsantan]] assaulted them and ripped off the [[Limb|arm]] of [[Unidentified Trandoshan gambler|one]] of them. Krrsantan subsequently paid his bill to the server.<ref name="The Gathering Storm">{{BOBF|Chapter 4: The Gathering Storm}}</ref>

===Pyke attack===
[[File:WatchingPykesLeave-BoBFCh6.png|thumb|right|300px|The Twi'lek stands beside Fwip and male colleague as the Pykes depart.]]
One night as two [[Pyke Syndicate]] members entered the Sanctuary, the Twi'lek spoke briefly with Fwip after the latter noticed the [[Pyke]]s entering. She then joined her male colleague and approached the Pykes after they sat down. Her colleague offered to clean their helmets, and the two Twi'leks departed after the patrons refused, meeting with Fwip where the female server informed the Madam of the refusal. The three Twi'leks watched the Pykes leave the Sanctuary as a [[GS-C1B|server droid]] attempted to inform the Pykes of their forgotten [[camtono]]. Then, an [[Destruction of Garsa Fwip's Sanctuary|explosion]] erupted within the Sanctuary, killing her.<ref name="From the Desert Comes a Stranger">{{BOBF|Chapter 6: From the Desert Comes a Stranger}}</ref>

==Personality and traits==
The Twi'lek female had yellow skin.<ref name="Stranger in a Strange Land" />

==Equipment==
The Twi'lek server wore a black [[Clothing|headwrap]] that covered the top of her head and the base of her [[lekku]]. She wore a two-piece outfit similar to a [[dancing-girl costume]], consisting of a metal top half and metal-and-fabric pants, revealing her midriff and back. She also wore a necklace and bracelets on both wrists.<ref name="Stranger in a Strange Land" />

==Behind the scenes==
The female Twi'lek server first appeared in "[[Chapter 1: Stranger in a Strange Land]],"<ref name="Stranger in a Strange Land" /> which released on [[Disney+]] on [[December 29]], [[2021]],<ref name="Disney+ Premiere">{{DisneyPlusYouTube|t9Ca4ARSfqA|Next On Disney+ &#124; December 2021}}</ref> and served as the premiere episode for ''[[Star Wars: The Book of Boba Fett]]''. She was played by [[Andrea Bartlow]].<ref name="Stranger in a Strange Land" />

